        (39, 'Minjar Fair, Chamba', 'An ancient week-long harvest festival celebrated in the historic Chaugan of Chamba, commemorating the victory of Raja Sahil Varman and the flourishing of maize tassels (minjar). Processions carry golden silk minjars to float in the sacred Ravi River.', 'lunar', 'https://himachaltourism.gov.in/', [('himachal-pradesh', 'chamba')], [7, 8]),
